      "observed": "The MAX31855 thermocouple interface ICs' SO (MISO) pins are tied to net NET0019, which is also the ESP32-C3 USB D- net (GPIO18). The ESP32's SPI MISO pin (GPIO10) is on NET0018, a separate net.",
      "expected": "All three MAX31855 SO pins should share the common SPI MISO net with the ESP32 GPIO10 (NET0018), per the spec: 'SO (pin 7, tri-state/MISO) are common nets (SCK, SO) tied to all three ICs and to the ESP32 (U1 GPIO5/SCK, GPIO10/SO)'.",
