      ],
      "impact": "The thermocouple MISO data is routed to the USB D- pin instead of the SPI MISO pin, so the firmware cannot read any thermocouple; the shared MISO bus is also shorted to the USB data line, potentially corrupting USB communication.",
      "confidence": 0.55
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic shows the MAX31855 thermocouple SO (MISO) outputs connected to net NET0019 (the ESP32 USB D-/GPIO18 net) rather than the SPI MISO net NET0018 (GPIO10), which would prevent thermocouple reads and bridge the SPI bus onto the USB data line."
}

